        464.55780029296875,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "severe respiratory distress (e.g. grunting, nasal flaring, very severe chest indrawing);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
